Z||000003||fierospeeder||06-11-2001||09:14 PM||||the gas chamber would have been better if you want something with more effect.  <BR>Ive seen death videos and the electric chair goes really quick but it does leave their eyes bleeding.<P>why not dissection alive??  uh that would be the most painful.  <P>For me, it would either be dissection alive, or staying in a dark 5X5 room for 23 hours for the rest of your life without anything to read or listen to.  Imagine the boredom.<P>capital punishment does cost more and i think its due to all the appeals they have to have before they are able to be executed.  6 years of court fees.||||reg||1
