Z||000020||DecadenceR||06-12-2001||04:32 PM||||Back in my lab Bio class in HS, we had some morbid females that used to get the class to discuss ways to kill people. Slow painful torture. I think my favorite idea, although pretty infeasable, would have been a perfect idea to use on McVeigh.<BR>Take a glass container, with a VERY small hole in it... Not drilled though. That would cause a problem.<BR>Strap him into a device similar to the chineese water torture, where the water would drip directly onto your forehead.<BR>Instead of the water bucket, you would use our glass container.<BR>Then,in the container, place a (this the infeasable part) frozen block of acid.<BR>As the acid melts, it runs down the hole, and *drip* onto his forehead.<BR>Very painful from what i've heard (i mean acid burning you) and slow enough to make him wish he was in the truck when it blew up....||||reg||1
